1. **SG-001 discord_oauth_login** -- Discord OAuth flow via Supabase with new user profile creation
2. **SG-002 member_profile_view** -- Profile viewing with logical deletion filtering
3. **SG-003 member_profile_edit** -- Profile editing with owner/admin authorization (IDOR-relevant: general users can only edit own profile, admins can edit any)
4. **SG-004 team_create** -- Admin-only team creation with uniqueness validation
5. **SG-005 team_assign_member** -- Admin-only member-to-team assignment with deleted-member guard
6. **SG-006 team_set_leader** -- Admin-only leader designation requiring team membership
7. **SG-007 generation_role_manage** -- Admin-only generation-to-Discord-role mapping with sync
8. **SG-008 member_soft_delete** -- Logical deletion with team cleanup cascade
9. **SG-009 admin_dashboard** -- Admin dashboard with dispatch to all management actions

All `.mmd` files written to `outputs/graphs/batch_w0b0_1775370916/clubhouse-manager/`. Key invariants cover authorization boundaries (owner vs admin), logical deletion consistency, and OAuth token validation.

